# See listings/02-auto-mock/.../org.mockito.plugins.MockMaker for the
# full rationale. Mockito 5's default "inline" mock maker installs a
# runtime Java agent via Byte Buddy's self-attach, which is
# restricted on JDK 24+. The subclass maker selected below works
# without an agent and handles every interface or non-final class
# we mock in this listing.

mock-maker-subclass
